# supercronic crontab, UTC (the container has no other time zone).
# Nothing runs on its own, to keep costs at zero while nobody uses the
# app: only what someone asked for in the web app. supercronic doesn't
# start a line while its previous run is still going, so nothing is
# started twice. For a daily import instead (05:00 UTC is 06:00/07:00 in
# Germany, well within the issue's "100 years ago" date):
#   0 5 * * * python /runner/run.py daily berliner-tageblatt
# Issues to import (fetch and every job up to publish, ~10 min each).
* * * * * python /runner/run.py import-requests
# Audio to render (~3 min).
* * * * * python /runner/run.py audio-requests
